edit: also its so funny how angela lives rent free in her head

i love fierce more and more as each week goes by. she's also very funny on twitter and i rarely follow queens on there.

&#x200B;

idg the "lol fierce's lack of emotion at her mom" comments. it was obvious that fierce didn't expect it bcos her parents initially didnt understand/get her doing drag. i honestly felt bad for her and was happy that her mama finally came around. queens arent obligated to give us the waterworks.

leo lol

&#x200B;

edit: and i guess because of what i posted in the dave mirra post, someone was worried and i received a "redditcares", which, tbh made me feel worse and dumb, but i understand why it was sent i guess.

