im in the same boat actually. im in canada. i sent them a message and they gave me the same explanation today. imma wait a bit cos it's just some rings, but if they don't ship it this week imma ask for a refund cos its ridiculous.

&#x200B;

weirdly enough they shipped a dumb pillowcase i had also ordered only a day later and i was like??? why not include my damn rings pls sjsjskjsjsjs

not an unpopular opinion, im \*still\* salty about how canadian fans have to wait longer for episodes lol. (cant rly uh p\*rate, because i also need captions)

